  "hh_ethnologue_comment": {
    "comment": "Zamba (or Dzamba) is a language of the Ngiri area of DRC (**hh:hv:Mangulu:Ngiri**:16, **hh:s:Kamanda:Zamba**:1-3). Consistent with the impression from sociolinguistics, lexicostatistical figures indicate that Zamba is not intelligible to the varieties around it (**hh:hv:Bastinetal:Bantu**:205). The language is missing from E16/E17/E18/E19/E20/E21/E22/E23/E24/E25/E26/E27/E28/E29.",
